# Agent tooling is versioned in THIS repo, overriding the global ignore rules
# (~/.gitignore_global excludes .claude/ and AGENTS.md everywhere).
# AGENTS.md is the operational source of truth and .claude/skills/ encodes the
# project's procedures, so both must travel with the code.
!.claude/
!AGENTS.md
.claude/settings.local.json
